  "description": {
   "en": "Melanie, a member of the prestigious Stewart family, is a \"dropout\" with little magic power. When her engagement is called off because of her lack of magical powers, she finds herself in the library, where she succeeds in deciphering an ancient lost language! However, when her uncle invites her to a magic school, Quinn, the best court magician in the country, discovers her hidden talent...?",
   "ja": "名門スチュワート家のメラニーは、魔力の乏しい落ちこぼれ。 ある日、公爵家のジュリアン・オルセンに婚約破棄を言い渡されたのだが…やがて出会ったのは運命の宮廷魔術師で!?"
  },
